{"slug":"iip-use-based-2022-23","path":"official","kind":"timeseries","page_url":"https://esankhyiki.mospi.gov.in/macroindicators?product=iip","frequency":"M","graph":"line","title":"IIP by use-based classification (base 2022-23)","description":"Monthly Index of Industrial Production on the current base 2022-23=100 (series starts April 2023), split by use-based group: primary, capital, intermediate and infrastructure/construction goods, consumer durables and non-durables, plus the overall index. Index levels are shown together with the year-on-year growth rates published by MoSPI. Capital goods and infrastructure/construction goods lead investment and capex, the consumer groups proxy household demand, which makes the split a core input for nowcasting GDP and GVA in industry. Quick estimates are released about 28 days after the month end and revised once, in the following month's release.","headline":{},"source":"MoSPI (eSankhyiki IIP API)","source_url":"https://esankhyiki.mospi.gov.in/macroindicators?product=iip","date_modified":null,"views":[{"id":"index","label":"Index (2022-23=100)","series":[{"id":"general","name":"Overall IIP","units":"Index (2022-23=100)","pts":[[1680307200,100.4],[1682899200,105.2],[1685577600,104.6],[1688169600,103.0],[1690848000,106.9],[1693526400,104.9],[1696118400,106.6],[1698796800,101.1],[1701388800,109.0],[1704067200,111.1],[1706745600,109.7],[1709251200,119.0],[1711929600,107.5],[1714521600,112.9],[1717200000,112.2],[1719792000,111.0],[1722470400,109.1],[1725148800,109.8],[1727740800,112.6],[1730419200,107.1],[1733011200,115.7],[1735689600,118.1],[1738368000,112.9],[1740787200,125.9],[1743465600,112.7],[1746057600,116.7],[1748736000,114.7],[1751328000,117.0],[1754006400,114.2],[1756684800,116.5],[1759276800,111.6],[1761955200,114.6],[1764547200,123.5],[1767225600,123.0],[1769904000,117.9],[1772323200,129.7],[1775001600,118.2],[1777593600,122.5],[1780272000,124.8],[1782864000,125.6],[1785542400,123.1],[1788220800,124.3]]},{"id":"primar